      "notes": "The Flourishing Index (FI) uses domains 1–5 (10 items, sum score 0–100). The Secure Flourishing Index (SFI) adds domain 6 (12 items, sum score 0–120). Each item rated 0–10 with domain-specific anchors. No reverse scoring. Validated in Global Flourishing Study. Translations from Global Flourishing Study translation project."
